ync\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">b9ed80b2-cedd-4008-a0d9-7ccf016a7bbf</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:b9ed80b2-cedd-4008-a0d9-7ccf016a7bbf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:b9ed80b2-cedd-4008-a0d9-7ccf016a7bbf\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal_Temple\" title=\"Bhaal Temple\">Bhaal Temple</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;859&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-22</span>: Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Orin\" title=\"Orin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e4/Portrait_Orin.png/25px-Portrait_Orin.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e4/Portrait_Orin.png/38px-Portrait_Orin.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e4/Portrait_Orin.png/50px-Portrait_Orin.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Orin\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e4/Portrait_Orin.png/25px-Portrait_Orin.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e4/Portrait_Orin.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Orin\" title=\"Orin\">Orin</a></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Given its transpositional magic, this ring is likely what Orin is seen touching or turning to (and then activating) after interacting with one of her disguises. The ring seems to have no purpose other than flavour or to be sold to <a href=\"/wiki/Traders\" title=\"Traders\">traders</a> for a bit of extra gold.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200622\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.054 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1557/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 18687/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4486/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 21/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.013/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1145794/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   47.975      1 Template:EquipmentPage\n100.00%   47.975      1 -total\n 30.16%   14.468      5 Template:Icon_text\n 25.84%   12.399     13 Template:Trim\n 22.70%   10.889      2 Template:Icon_link\n 21.39%   10.264      2 Template:Uid\n 20.12%    9.654      1 Template:WeaponType\n 18.76%    9.002      6 Template:Ifempty\n 12.58%    6.035      4 Template:Main_namespace_only\n 11.57%    5.552      2 Template:Template_style\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:41774-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714200622 and revision id 294100. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}